  "title": "Firefly Neuroscience Forms Strategic Partnership with Neurology Consultants of Dallas",
  "summary": "Firefly Neuroscience, Inc., an AI technology company developing innovative neuroscientific solutions that improve brain health outcomes for patients with mental illnesses and neurological disorders, announced that it has formed a strategic partnership with the Neurology Consultants of Dallas to help enhance early detection efforts and disease management for patients suffering from cognitive decline.",
